    "detailed_description": "Arrange the flowers in the pot, and if three identical flowers are next to each other, they will merge into a new flower of a higher rank (the new flower has one more petal).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/dfe8e40ade2c7ec8e482b5268106e6ed.poster.avif?t=1725010668\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/dfe8e40ade2c7ec8e482b5268106e6ed.webm?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/dfe8e40ade2c7ec8e482b5268106e6ed.mp4?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don't forget to balance the pot with all the flowers in it! If the pot tilts to one side too much, the whole structure will collapse and you'll have to start over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/b0ac680154879a294715232228e061a0.poster.avif?t=1725010668\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/b0ac680154879a294715232228e061a0.webm?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/b0ac680154879a294715232228e061a0.mp4?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A game with new and clear mechanics. Which flower will you be able to reach?",
    "about_the_game": "Arrange the flowers in the pot, and if three identical flowers are next to each other, they will merge into a new flower of a higher rank (the new flower has one more petal).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/dfe8e40ade2c7ec8e482b5268106e6ed.poster.avif?t=1725010668\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/dfe8e40ade2c7ec8e482b5268106e6ed.webm?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/dfe8e40ade2c7ec8e482b5268106e6ed.mp4?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don't forget to balance the pot with all the flowers in it! If the pot tilts to one side too much, the whole structure will collapse and you'll have to start over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/b0ac680154879a294715232228e061a0.poster.avif?t=1725010668\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/b0ac680154879a294715232228e061a0.webm?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900490/extras/b0ac680154879a294715232228e061a0.mp4?t=1725010668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A game with new and clear mechanics. Which flower will you be able to reach?",
